Third-party material referenced by this repository:

- The Rails stack layer describes a boilerplate derived from `minimal.rb` in
  lewagon/rails-templates (MIT, Copyright 2017 Le Wagon). No code from it is
  contained here; it lives in romain-nicod/rails-ready.
- `docs/DESIGN_CHECKLIST.md` maps the components of the Le Wagon UI Kit
  (https://uikit.lewagon.com/documentation), which is Le Wagon's work. Only
  the component and class names are cited; no HTML or CSS is reproduced, and
  the guidance around them is our own.
